   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Where it runs\nToday: one Docker Compose stack on a workstation (PostgreSQL,\nobject store, Airflow, MinerU, one image per connector). Later\non AWS: ECS tasks, Aurora Serverless v2, S3, EFS, Parameter\nStore — deferred until every phase is built.",
   "originalText": "Where it runs\nToday: one Docker Compose stack on a workstation (PostgreSQL,\nobject store, Airflow, MinerU, one image per connector). Later\non AWS: ECS tasks, Aurora Serverless v2, S3, EFS, Parameter\nStore — deferred until every phase is built.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "center",
   "verticalAlign": "middle",
   "containerId": "deploy",
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
